        <activityName xml:lang="en">Borehole heat exchanger, per m</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Borehole heat exchanger, per m
Inventory for the production of a 300m deep borehole heat exchanger with a life time of at least 50 years.;
Synonyms: Erdsonde inkl. Bohrung, Dupplex-Erdsonde; 
UUID: 1fc967aa-2e67-370e-a8aa-6d7514066919
Infrastructure of the geothermal probe, including all material inputs (pipes and backfill material, coolant) and also the energy use for building the borehole with machines. Disposal of intertwaste.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1fc967aa-2e67-370e-a8aa-6d7514066919.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
